T* /F1 16 Tf (Executive Summary: Enterprise AI and RAG Architecture Report 2025) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* () Tj
T* /F1 13 Tf (1. Overview and Market Dynamics) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* (In 2025, enterprise adoption of Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) reached an all-time high.) Tj
T* (Over 78 percent of surveyed organizations reported integrating internal vector knowledge bases.) Tj
T* (Without grounded retrieval, baseline Large Language Models exhibited a hallucination rate of 28.4 percent.) Tj
T* (Implementing grounded RAG pipelines with strict citation constraints reduced hallucination to under 1.8 percent.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* /F1 13 Tf (2. Strategic Goals and Funding) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* (The primary initiative, codenamed Project Titan, aims to automate enterprise document intelligence.) Tj
T* (The target completion date is Q4 2025 with an allocated research grant of 15.5 million dollars.) Tj
T* (Key stakeholders include engineering, security governance, and customer support divisions.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
