T* /F1 16 Tf (Section 2: Performance Benchmarks and Cost Analysis) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* () Tj
T* /F1 13 Tf (1. Infrastructure and Latency Benchmarks) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* (Vector search using FAISS with L2 index achieved an average retrieval latency of 14.2 milliseconds.) Tj
T* (In contrast, dense vector search across unindexed clusters required over 240 milliseconds.) Tj
T* (The end-to-end question-answering pipeline using Google Gemini 1.5 Flash averaged 820ms response time.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* /F1 13 Tf (2. Financial ROI and Efficiency Gains) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* (Enterprise infrastructure costs decreased by 62 percent after migrating from self-hosted LLMs to Gemini API.) Tj
T* (Total verified annual cost savings reached 4.6 million dollars across all operating units.) Tj
T* (Support resolution time dropped from 45 minutes per ticket to 3.5 minutes per ticket using automated RAG.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
