T* /F1 16 Tf (Section 3: Security, Governance and Source Verification) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* () Tj
T* /F1 13 Tf (1. Compliance Standards) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* (The RAG system complies with SOC2 Type II, ISO 27001, HIPAA, and GDPR data residency standards.) Tj
T* (No proprietary user data or PDF content is retained for external model retraining.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* /F1 13 Tf (2. Auditability and Verifiable Citations) Tj /F1 12 Tf
T* (All responses generated by the conversational chain must cite original source page numbers.) Tj
T* (Conversational memory uses a sliding window of 5 turns to prevent context window overflow.) Tj
T* (In case of conflicting data, the retriever defaults to the highest semantic similarity score.) Tj
ET
endstream
